--------------------------------------------------------------------------
go-ethereum (LGPL-3.0)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

The `exchange` binary, and the container images published from this
repository, statically link libraries from go-ethereum
(https://github.com/ethereum/go-ethereum), which are licensed under the GNU
Lesser General Public License version 3.0. Only library packages are used --
`common`, `core/types`, `crypto`, `ethclient` and the root package -- and
nothing under go-ethereum's own `cmd/`, which carries GPL-3.0.

The version linked is recorded in go.mod. Its complete corresponding source
is available from the upstream repository at that version, and a copy of the
LGPL-3.0 text ships alongside it there.

`exchangectl` does not link go-ethereum and is Apache-2.0 throughout.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Everything else
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

The remaining dependencies are Apache-2.0, BSD, MIT, ISC or MPL-2.0. The
full list, with versions and licence texts, is in THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md,
which is generated from go.mod by `make notices` rather than maintained by
hand.
